<title>UK: SBC unit sets $250 million six-year bond.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets $250 million six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    18.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.38    PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.78     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JER</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT AUGUST 2001 TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
